{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00758","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享惠昭太子庙乐章 亚献终献 · 裴度","name":"郊庙歌辞 享惠昭太子庙乐章 亚献终献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重轮始发祥，齿胄方兴学。\n冥然升紫府，铿尔荐清乐。\n奠斝致馨香，在庭纷羽龠。\n礼成神既醉，髣髴缑山鹤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}